---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main>
    <section class="experience">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="section-tag">
          Experience
        </p>

        <h2>
          Product and engineering experience shaped by strategy, execution, and user impact.
        </h2>

        <div class="experience-list">
          <div class="experience-item">
            <div class="experience-rail">
              <span class="experience-dot"></span>
              <span class="experience-line"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="experience-body">
              <span class="experience-date">Jul 2025 – May 2026</span>
              <h3>Software Developer, IBM ZCodeScan</h3>
              <p>
                • Contributed to the GA launch of IBM ZCodeScan, an AI-enhanced static code analysis tool for
                COBOL and PL/I, expanding its rule library by 69 rules and helping make the product available
                to over 193,000 developers through the IBM Z Open Editor extension.
                <br />
                • Partnered with Product Managers and Designers to address customer pain points and built
                AI-powered developer workflows and CI/CD enhancements that saved developers 4–8 hours per
                week and helped reduce downstream production bugs by up to 15×.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="experience-item">
            <div class="experience-rail">
              <span class="experience-dot"></span>
              <span class="experience-line"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="experience-body">
              <span class="experience-date">Jan 2025 – Jul 2025</span>
              <h3>Software Developer Intern, IBM ZCodeScan</h3>
              <p>
                • Contributed as part of a four-member product engineering team, helping shape and deliver
                improvements across detection rules, static analysis workflows, CLI capabilities, testing,
                and reporting.
                <br />
                • Focused on translating product needs into reliable engineering solutions, validating
                workflows against user expectations, and improving the overall developer experience.
                <br />
                • Built extension prototypes to explore emerging use cases and contributed to product
                discussions around future AI-assisted capabilities, helping connect technical possibilities
                with potential user value.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="experience-item">
            <div class="experience-rail">
              <span class="experience-dot"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="experience-body">
              <span class="experience-date">May 2024 – Jul 2024</span>
              <h3>Software Development Engineer Intern, Amazon</h3>
              <p>
                • Enhanced reconciliation workflows by building system alerts to detect financial irregularities
                and stale configurations, enabling business teams to proactively identify issues and update
                rules from their end.
                <br />
                • Worked across data pipelines and ETL processes to optimize large-scale data processing.
                <br />
                • Partnered with cross-functional stakeholders to translate business needs into product
                requirements and priorities, and documented the journey from proof of concept to MVP.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>


<style>
.experience {
  padding: 120px 0 80px;
}

.experience-list {
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
}

.experience-item {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:24px 1fr;
  gap:32px;
}

.experience-rail {
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;
}

.experience-dot {
  width:14px;
  height:14px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--bg-primary);
  border:3px solid var(--accent);
  flex-shrink:0;
  margin-top:6px;
}

.experience-line {
  flex:1;
  width:1px;
  background:var(--border);
  margin-top:6px;
}

.experience-body {
  padding-bottom:48px;
}

.experience-date {
  display:inline-block;
  color:var(--accent);
  font-size:0.9rem;
  font-weight:600;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.experience-body h3 {
  font-size:1.25rem;
  margin-bottom:14px;
}

.experience-body p {
  color:var(--text-secondary);
  max-width:680px;
  line-height:1.9;
}

@media(max-width:800px){

  .experience {
    padding:100px 0 60px;
  }

  .experience-item {
    grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;
    gap:18px;
  }

  .experience-dot {
    width:10px;
    height:10px;
  }

}

@media(max-width:480px){

  .experience {
    padding:90px 0 60px;
  }

}
</style>
